flowchart LR
  USER[Authenticated user] --> AUTH[Identity and tenant verification]
  AUTH --> RET[Permission-aware retrieval]
  RET --> LABEL[Provenance and untrusted labels]
  LABEL --> CTX[Context minimization and redaction]
  CTX --> LLM[LLM adapter]
  LLM --> POLICY{Server-side capability policy}
  POLICY -->|Allowed| TOOL[Least-privilege tool]
  POLICY -->|Denied| DENY[No tool invocation]
  TOOL --> OUT[Output classification and redaction]
  DENY --> AUDIT[Privacy-safe audit]
  OUT --> AUDIT
  OUT --> USER
